lace to the left).\n   - 99900 (from step 3, shifted two places to the left).\n\n   Adding these numbers together:.\n   ```.\n     143.\n   +2820.\n   +99900.\n   ------.\n   102863.\n   ```. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
