gether:.\n- Ones place: \\(8 + 4 + 2 = 14\\).\n- Tens place: \\(3 + 3 + 3 = 9\\).\n- Hundreds place: \\(12\\).\n- Thousands place: \\(3\\). Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
